          "text": "Description: On February 27, 1976 (there is an uncertainty about the exact date in the report) around 8:50 PM, a driver observed for a few seconds at low altitude the very fast movement from north to south of a very bright red sphere. Several people in the area, when questioned, claimed to have noticed nothing unusual that evening. This case is classified as C due to a lack of information.",
